<article class="env-exercise" id="0DBA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DBA">Exercise <span data-tag="0DBA">111.44.7</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $X = \mathbf{P}|^1 \times \mathbf{P}^1$ be the product of the projective line over $k$ with itself with projections $p : X \to \mathbf{P}^1_ k$ and $q : X \to \mathbf{P}^1_ k$. Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathcal{O}(a, b) = p^*\mathcal{O}_{\mathbf{P}^1_ k}(a) \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ X} q^*\mathcal{O}_{\mathbf{P}^1_ k}(b)  \]
</div>
  <p> Compute the dimensions of $H^ i(X, \mathcal{O}(a, b))$ for all $i, a, b$. Hint: Use Exercise <a href="/tag/0DB9" data-tag="0DB9">111.44.6</a>. </p>
</article>